WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Begin in Eka Pada Rajakapotasana with the front shin grounded and the back leg extended.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Bend the back knee, drawing the heel toward the glute.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Reach the same-side hand back to catch the foot, elbow lifting toward the sky.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
If it's available, walk the hand further to hold the foot with both hands, gently drawing it toward the crown.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Keep lifting the chest rather than collapsing into the low back; release slowly and switch sides.
